        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Yarrow, Noel Paul Stookey, Mary Travers, Peter, Paul and Mary\n- Topics: Leather-winged bat, song lyrics, musical performances\n\nFacts:\n- Peter, Paul and Mary's 1969 version included the lyric sequence \"a bat, a black bird, wood pecker, turtle dove, and a blue jay.\"\n- Peter, Paul and Mary are associated with a version referenced on the Leather-Winged Bat page.\n- After Mary Travers died in 2009, Peter Yarrow and Noel Paul Stookey continued performing as a duo under their individual names.",
